{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/029",
  "family": "JUG80"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u04784",
   "en": "Charges are set. Everyone get low. Now!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04785",
   "en": "The charges are set and ready. Everybody get low and keep your head down!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04786",
   "en": "Commander, I'm bringing us in. I'll get as close to the site as I can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04787",
   "en": "Negative. It's too hot! You can't risk it. We'll hold them off as long as we--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04788",
   "en": "Negative. It's too hot! Can't risk it. We'll hold them off as long as we--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04789",
   "en": "I'm on it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04790",
   "en": "Commander, set that nuke and get out! We can't hold them.... Damn it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04791",
   "en": "They believe Sovereign to be some kind of god. The pinnacle of their own evolution. But the reaction of their deity is most telling: it is insulted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04792",
   "en": "Sovereign does not desire the pitiful devotions the geth hurl at it. They are just tools, and no amount of belief on their part will change that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04793",
   "en": "Do not mire yourself in pointless revolt. Do not sacrifice everything for the sake of petty freedoms. The Protheans tried to fight, and they were utterly destroyed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04794",
   "en": "I'm not doing this for myself! Don't you see? Sovereign will succeed. It is inevitable. My way is the only way any of us will survive!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04795",
   "en": "I'm forging an alliance between us and the Reapers. Between organics and machines. And in doing so, I will save more lives than have ever existed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04796",
   "en": "But you would undo my work. You would doom our entire civilization to complete annihilation. And for that, you must die.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04797",
   "en": "Damn you, human! This facility was more than reinforcement. It was inoculation!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04798",
   "en": "So be it. You may have taken the day. But this is not over.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04799",
   "en": "Goodbye, Shepard. You have ensured we will meet again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04800",
   "en": "You're like every other poor bastard in this place. A tool Sovereign can use, then cast aside.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04801",
   "en": "You're just a puppet!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04802",
   "en": "We can stop them!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04803",
   "en": "I applaud you, Shepard. My geth were utterly convinced the salarians were the real threat. An impressive diversion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04804",
   "en": "Of course, it was all for nothing. I can't let you disrupt what I have accomplished here. You can't possibly understand what's really at stake.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04805",
   "en": "You've seen the vision from the beacons, Shepard. You, of all people, should understand what the Reapers are capable of. They cannot be stopped.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04806",
   "en": "Once I understood this, I joined Sovereign, though I was aware of the... dangers. I had hoped this facility could protect me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04807",
   "en": "I've studied the effects of indoctrination. The more control Sovereign exerts, the less capable the subject becomes. That is my saving grace.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04808",
   "en": "Sovereign and its kind destroyed the Protheans! What else is there to understand?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04809",
   "en": "This isn't complicated. You'll do anything to get power. Even joining with the Reapers!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04810",
   "en": "You're afraid Sovereign is influencing you. You're afraid he's controlling your thoughts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04811",
   "en": "You work for a Reaper!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04812",
   "en": "You don't fool me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04813",
   "en": "So make me understand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04814",
   "en": "But it's not working is it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04815",
   "en": "You need to move fast, Commander. We can't hold them off here much longer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04816",
   "en": "Watch the corners! Suppressing fire!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04817",
   "en": "Commander, you need to move fast. We can't hold these things off much longer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04818",
   "en": "This has been an impressive diversion, Shepard. My geth were utterly convinced the salarians were the real threat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04819",
   "en": "There's no more time, Commander. The nuke is set. Get out while you can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04820",
   "en": "It's done, Shepard. The nuke is set. Get out while you can. Please.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04821",
   "en": "Suppressing fire! Cover your flank! Cover your--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04822",
   "en": "Commander, you need to set the nuke and get out. We can't hold...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04823",
   "en": "Left flank, left flank! Suppressing fire! Suppress--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04824",
   "en": "This thing's ticking, Commander. We don't have a lot of time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04825",
   "en": "We're all clear on this end, but that nuke's set to go. We don't have much time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04826",
   "en": "No one gets left behind. We're going after Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04827",
   "en": "We've got time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04828",
   "en": "I no longer believe that, Shepard. The visions cannot be denied. The Reapers are too powerful. The only hope of survival is to join with them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04829",
   "en": "Do you think you can sway me, Shepard? Do you think I haven't already thought of this?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04830",
   "en": "Sovereign is a machine. It thinks like a machine. If I can prove my value, I become a resource worth maintaining. There is no other logical conclusion!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04831",
   "en": "But as tools, they are useful. They will survive the coming invasion. If organic life is to survive, we must also prove we are useful. We must work with the Reapers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04832",
   "en": "That's the order I was waiting for!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04833",
   "en": "Trillions dead. But what if they had bowed before the invaders? Would the Protheans still exist? Is submission not preferable to extinction?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04834",
   "en": "Now you see why I never came forward with this to the Council. We organics are driven by emotion instead of logic. We will fight even when we know we cannot win.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04835",
   "en": "But if we work with the Reapers--if we make ourselves useful--think how many lives could be spared!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04836",
   "en": "Sovereign needs me to find the Conduit. My mind is still my own... for now. But the transformation from ally to servant can be subtle. I will not let it happen to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04837",
   "en": "The Conduit is the key to your destruction and my salvation. Sovereign needs my help to find it. That is the only reason I have not been indoctrinated.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04838",
   "en": "No! Sovereign needs me. If I find the Conduit, I've been promised a reprieve from the inevitable. This is my only hope.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04839",
   "en": "Tell me why Sovereign needs the Conduit. Tell me what it is. Maybe we can find a way to stop them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04840",
   "en": "Sovereign's manipulating you and you don't even know it! You're already under its power!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04841",
   "en": "Together we can stop Sovereign. We don't have to submit to the Reapers. We can beat them!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04842",
   "en": "Don't you see? You're just a tool. Sovereign's using you. In the end you'll be tossed aside with all the rest.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04843",
   "en": "Why are the geth following Sovereign?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04844",
   "en": "You were a Spectre. You were sworn to defend the galaxy. Then you broke that vow to save yourself!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04845",
   "en": "I'm not like you. I'd rather die fighting than live as a slave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04846",
   "en": "No one gets left behind. We're going after the lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04847",
   "en": "I'd rather die than live under the rule of those machines!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04848",
   "en": "Do you really believe the Reapers will let us live?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04849",
   "en": "I won't be a slave!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04850",
   "en": "You're fooling yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04851",
   "en": "It's already happened!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_07_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_13_CIN_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04852",
   "en": "The Conduit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
